Copyright: 2026 skycue maintainers
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: skycue's own generator scripts and notes for the FIS-B fixtures.
 The third-party test captures (stratux, dump978, fisb-decode, pyModeS) and
 the files derived from them are not part of the source or of any binary
 package: scripts/fetch-test-captures.sh downloads them on demand for tests
 and tests/fixtures/README.md gives each one's origin and licence text.

